WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:03.599
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:03.599 --> 00:00:04.620
- All right, all right.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.911
Everyday I like to find
something awesome on social media

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:08.550
that you may have overlooked,

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.540
I don't want you to miss out.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.373
You're welcome.

00:00:10.373 --> 00:00:11.206
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:14.070
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.990
There's nothing like that joy of knowing

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.314
you've got a baby on the way.

00:00:17.314 --> 00:00:20.010
There's also nothing quite like the agony

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.500
of morning sickness, it sucks.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.036
But check out how one two-year-old
tried to comfort her mama

00:00:26.036 --> 00:00:28.623
when a wave of nausea hit.

00:00:29.877 --> 00:00:32.540
- It's okay.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.383
I love, Mom.

00:00:34.383 --> 00:00:35.784
- I love you too.

00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:36.867
- I love you.

00:00:39.057 --> 00:00:39.890
It's okay.

00:00:41.345 --> 00:00:42.537
It's okay, Mom.

00:00:42.537 --> 00:00:43.425
- Thanks, sweetie.

00:00:43.425 --> 00:00:44.258
- It's okay.

00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:45.116
- [Audience] Aww.

00:00:45.116 --> 00:00:46.039
- I mean...

00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:49.367
(audience applauding)

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:50.200
That video is tricky,

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.570
it makes you wanna have more kids,

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.860
and you shouldn't always do that.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.880
But we have little Rosie on the line now,

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.320
along with her mama, Katherine,

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.362
watching on St. Louis FOX2,

00:01:00.362 --> 00:01:01.526
what's up y'all?

00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:03.150
- Hi Kelly.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.383
- Hi.

00:01:04.383 --> 00:01:05.220
Oh my gosh, you're adorable.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.823
So, Katherine, did you get sick a lot,

00:01:07.823 --> 00:01:09.360
the morning sickness?

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.193
I did.

00:01:10.193 --> 00:01:12.002
- I did, I got so sick.

00:01:12.002 --> 00:01:13.620
Not so much with Rosie,

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.020
but the second pregnancy was just brutal,

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.910
and I was sick the whole nine months,

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.080
which is great.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:19.913
- [Kelly] Me too.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.292
- Rosie got used to me...

00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:22.140
(Katherine laughs)

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:25.066
She got used to me running
to the bathroom quite often.

00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:27.020
- Yeah, it's miserable.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:30.933
So, Rosie, what's your favorite
part of being a sister?

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:36.330
(audience laughing)

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.710
- She likes giving him hugs

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:38.640
and kisses,

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.370
and helping me put him to bed at night,

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.201
which sometimes that's more
distracting than helpful,

00:01:44.201 --> 00:01:47.430
but it's been sweet.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.330
- How far apart are they?

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.276
Mine are 22 months apart,

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:53.531
so my eldest has been momming
the youngest for a minute.

00:01:53.531 --> 00:01:56.639
- They're almost, just
shy of three years apart.

00:01:56.639 --> 00:01:57.810
- [Kelly] Oh, awesome.

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.060
- It's a good age where she can help,

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.492
and kind of understand what's going on,

00:02:01.492 --> 00:02:03.930
but then they'll also be
able to grow up together,

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.611
which I'm really excited to watch them

00:02:05.611 --> 00:02:07.710
kind of create that bond.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:08.543
- Yeah.

00:02:08.543 --> 00:02:09.383
I love that I have an older girl,

00:02:09.383 --> 00:02:10.770
and the younger is a boy,

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:11.940
I think that's just really sweet,

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:12.773
it's nice to watch.

00:02:12.773 --> 00:02:13.606
But you do have to be like

00:02:13.606 --> 00:02:15.413
"You're not the mom, calm down."

00:02:15.413 --> 00:02:16.500
(indistinct)

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.880
Well, Rosie, thank you so much

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:18.786
for being so sweet,

00:02:18.786 --> 00:02:21.120
and helping your mama when
she wasn't feeling well.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.154
Katherine, you're doing such a great job,

00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:23.730
beautiful kiddo.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:24.990
Thank you so much for sharing this,

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.591
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:02:26.591 --> 00:02:29.160
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.390
All right, well that's not all, Rosie.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.460
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.293
makers of Frixion,

00:02:33.293 --> 00:02:34.320
the go to erasable pen

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.370
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.046
want to celebrate your growing family,

00:02:37.046 --> 00:02:39.002
so they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:39.002 --> 00:02:41.110
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:43.770
- Wow, thank you so much.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:47.730
- Oh my gosh, your eyes are so beautiful.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.560
Aww, now I want another baby,

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.719
this is not good.

00:02:50.719 --> 00:02:51.570
(audience laughing)

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:52.770
Thank you guys so much,

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.970
have a wonderful evening.

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:55.191
And thank you so much to
all our guests this hour,

00:02:55.191 --> 00:02:57.738
Daniel Radcliffe, Lindsay Mendez,

00:02:57.738 --> 00:02:59.580
Jonathan Groff, Alix Earle,

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.482
Terry, Jen and Joy,

00:03:00.482 --> 00:03:02.188
and (indistinct).

00:03:02.188 --> 00:03:03.021
Y'all have a great day,

00:03:03.021 --> 00:03:04.911
and if it's not try and change it.

00:03:04.911 --> 00:03:05.753
(upbeat music)

